{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"514","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"0","news_title":"台中園區挖掘道路埋設管線（#366）施工公告","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:12px\">申挖單位：台灣自來水股份有限公司中區工程處第一工務所</span><br />\n<span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:12px\">挖掘目的：為辦理西平南巷送水管工程</span><br />\n<span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:12px\">施工地點：西平南巷0K$#!!110(鄰近中科高壓電塔)~0K$#!!620(鄰近友達光電)</span><br />\n<span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:12px\">交管方式：分段施工並派專人疏導交通</span><br />\n<span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:12px\">施工日期：105年8月8日至105年9月7日</span><br />\n<span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:12px\">列管編號：第366號</span><br />\n<span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:12px\">工地聯絡人：朱博能（04-25360039#246）</span><br />\n<span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:12px\">管理單位：中科管理局營建組</span></p>\n\n<p>詳情請見中科管理局官網：http://www.ctsp.gov.tw/chinese/01news/11online_view.aspx?v=1$=!!amp;fr=17$=!!amp;no=34$=!!amp;sn=4805</p>\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"514","create_date":"2016-08-09","clk_count":"206"}},"__N_SSG":true}